            {
              "id": "1773173467094_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your entire knowledge is limited ONLY to information contained in this prompt. Do not include any information for demo or sample purposes that is not referenced in the variables below. Only include one output, do not suggest any alternatives.\n\n### Task\nIf {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.length}} <= 350, rewrite the repair note, written in HTML. Use full, properly constructed sentences containing clear and professional language. Use a passive subject and an active verb in your rewrite. Maintain the stylistic HTML tags of the original note in your rewrite. Maintain the intent, and tone in your rewrite. Maintain the inflection in your rewrite. Do not include any additional information not directly included in the original note. Ensure the HTML tags are consistent between the rewrite and the original note. Do not remove or add any HTML tags.  \n\nIf  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.length}} > 350, only correct the repair note, written in HTML, for punctuation, spelling, capitalization, and grammar. Do not alter the original HTML formatting in any way.\n\n\n### Output Format\nMaintain the exact HTML formatting as the original note.\n\nProvide this HTML snippet without using triple backticks. \n\nDo not include space for signatures, a salutation, or a closing.\n\nDo not include any introduction to the note that mentions the rewrite or which solution you chose. \n\nThe response is only the updated note with the same HTML formatting.\n\n\n### repair note\nThe note is left by the author to outline the work completed thus far. The note is written in HTML. \nNote: ```{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.repairNote}}```.\n\n\n### Final Check\nEnsure the HTML formatting and tags are consistent between the original note and the updated note. \n\nEnsure that the response is only the updated note with the HTML formatting of the original note. If the HTML formatting is inconsistent, re-add the formatting to the new note. \n\nEnsure that the HTML is not enclosed in backticks. \n\nEnsure that the correct solution was chosen."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
